cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Ludix: a game-agnostic suite backend with a learning-analytics dashboard"
abstract: >-
  Ludix is a suite that hosts many self-contained learning games behind one
  Node/Express/SQLite backend and a game-agnostic educator dashboard. Games
  post runs and events keyed by gameId; the dashboard provides engagement
  metrics, process mining, transition-network analysis (TNA), and sequence
  clustering with no per-game code.
